@format 1
@id merge.remove-file
@title Remove file from merge group
@area Merge
@entry input
@summary Remove one source from one merge group while retaining the group even when it becomes empty.
@flow TB
@related merge.remove-group

@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup

[input] Group file removal requested <input>
- Receive the remove command for a group source row @ group.PGroupItemRemove(...)
> remove

[remove] Remove membership <process>
- Remove the source from its group and rebuild group cards @ group.PGroupItemRemove(...)
> result

[result] Group source removed <output>
= The source no longer participates in that merge group; an empty group remains until separately removed.
